OL,3,GNEWSACustomers critical after being
OL,4,Aleft without water
OL,5,
OL,6,FBuckfastleigh resident Dawn Austin, 72,
OL,7,Fsaid she had not had "even a trickle"
OL,8,Fof water since 22:00 BST on Thursday
OL,9,Fand by Friday afternoon had not
OL,10,Freceived help from South West Water.
